{"unit_id":"stickyfinger7__dsh-quote-annotation#caveat-2","repo":"stickyfinger7/dsh-quote-annotation","commit":"de7d3d159cd1b339cc3dd49941abec8458997d32","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-quote-annotation 使用前须知：发送胶囊和行内标记依赖 Web 聊天页面的 DOM 选择器；页面结构变化时，这些位置增强可能需要适配（见 lib/client.js:883-900）。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:883-900"]}
